  {"text":"An electronic queue at the asteroid belt. Nobody here is in a hurry. Except you.","translation":"小行星帶的電子排隊。這裡沒有人趕時間。除了你。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"Belt-East checkpoint. Forty minutes' flight to Jupiter. Eleven days to the window.","translation":"「環帶東」檢查站。飛到木星四十分鐘。排到窗口要十一天。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"They invented the warp drive. They couldn't get rid of form F-12 in triplicate.","translation":"曲速引擎發明出來了。F-12 表格一式三份，卻始終廢除不了。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[1] text"},
  {"text":"Gena filled it in twice. The third copy floated away.","translation":"根納填了兩次。第三份飄走了。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/scene.json captions[2] text"},
  {"text":"Window 3 is open again.","translation":"3 號窗口重新開放了。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"Window 3 has closed for a technical break.","translation":"3 號窗口暫停服務，技術性休息。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
  {"text":"A golden yacht with a flashing light went straight to the window, no queue. Your number has been recalculated.","translation":"一艘閃著警示燈的金色遊艇不用排隊，直接開到了窗口。你的號碼已重新計算。","where":"worlds/window-3/scenes/window-3/script.js"},
